WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.115
Four old sounds come back first today.

2
00:00:02.565 --> 00:00:05.144
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

3
00:00:05.644 --> 00:00:09.569
The Bring back strip. Point to each letter. Your child says its sound.

4
00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:18.033
The strip is in a new order every day, so your child cannot say it by heart.

5
00:00:18.483 --> 00:00:20.827
Now the two new ones. Here is the first.

6
00:00:21.956 --> 00:00:24.409
As in igloo. Hug your arms and shiver.

7
00:00:25.838 --> 00:00:26.689
And the second.

8
00:00:28.039 --> 00:00:30.568
As in nest. Cup your hands, like a nest.

9
00:00:32.217 --> 00:00:35.046
Both are long sounds. Your child can hold them.

10
00:00:35.496 --> 00:00:39.795
Say the names of the six pictures in job two together. Then step away.

11
00:00:40.245 --> 00:00:45.284
At the end, your child says five sounds to you. Tomorrow is a short check, and a game.
